RUN: %PLC -c --fpic %S/properties_lib.st -o %t.lib.o
RUN: %COMPILE -i %S/properties_lib.st %S/properties_main.st %t.lib.o && %RUN | %CHECK %s

properties_lib.st is compiled to its own object. properties_main.st includes it
and links that object. The property accessors must be defined only in the
object built from properties_lib.st.

